{"uid":"52f3593ed3e684d7","name":"test_watcher_production_profile_az_blocked","fullName":"tests.integration.ha_tests.test_stereo_mode#test_watcher_production_profile_az_blocked","time":{},"description":"Test watcher with profile=production blocks on AZ co-location.\n\nWhen all units are in the same availability zone (common on single-host\nLXD deployments), a watcher with profile=production should enter\nBlockedStatus because it shares an AZ with the PostgreSQL units.\nThis validates the AZ enforcement behavior.\n\nIf JUJU_AVAILABILITY_ZONE is not set (some CI environments), the watcher\nshould reach active status since no AZ co-location can be detected.\n\nSince watcher-offer has limit: 1, we must remove the existing testing watcher\nbefore deploying the production one, then restore it afterward.\n","descriptionHtml":"<p>Test watcher with profile=production blocks on AZ co-location.</p>\n<p>When all units are in the same availability zone (common on single-host<br />\nLXD deployments), a watcher with profile=production should enter<br />\nBlockedStatus because it shares an AZ with the PostgreSQL units.<br />\nThis validates the AZ enforcement behavior.</p>\n<p>If JUJU_AVAILABILITY_ZONE is not set (some CI environments), the watcher<br />\nshould reach active status since no AZ co-location can be detected.</p>\n<p>Since watcher-offer has limit: 1, we must remove the existing testing watcher<br />\nbefore deploying the production one, then restore it afterward.</p>\n","status":"unknown","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[],"afterStages":[],"labels":[{"name":"tag","value":"abort_on_fail"},{"name":"tag","value":"asyncio"},{"name":"parentSuite","value":"tests.integration.ha_tests"},{"name":"suite","value":"test_stereo_mode"},{"name":"host","value":"runnervm3lb7s"},{"name":"framework","value":"pytest"},{"name":"language","value":"cpython3"},{"name":"package","value":"tests.integ